## Visual Studio Code settings
## Root only. A bare ".vscode/" also matches at depth and would cancel the
## firmware/*/.vscode rules above, which keep .clangd and extensions.json.
## settings.json is kept: it disables the cpptools engine and configures clangd.
/.vscode/*
!/.vscode/settings.json
!/.vscode/tasks.json

